  "details": "After months of vrchat not starting up, The (at the time) new easychat update made vrchat bootable, but only after the sign in screen it crashed and gave me \"The instruction at 0xb9e5f8ed referenced memory at 0x00000000. The memory could not be read.\" After the crash, I started VR Chat for the second time, and my computer was in a bluescreen afterwards. When I viewed the bluescreen log, it said the error came from EasyAntiChat_EOS.sys\nVersion: 2022.2.2?",
